# Keep the Docker build context lean and prevent host build artifacts
# (notably src/web/node_modules) from overwriting the in-container install.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular
**/.npm-cache
**/.git
**/.build-log.txt
**/*.log

# Test tooling and docs — never needed in the image. Excluding e2e/ keeps
# the build context small (e2e/tools alone is a ~100 MB local Node install).
e2e/
docs/
out/
mainspec_v2.json
api-client/package-lock.json
src/web/package-lock.json
